Experimental support for Pascal (Delphi / Free Pascal): `languages: [pascal]`
(aliases `delphi`, `objectpascal`) for .pas, .dpr, .dpk and .lpr files (also
in upper case, e.g. .PAS). Conditional compilation ({$IFDEF}, {$IF},
{$ELSE}...) is resolved before parsing against a default Delphi/Win32 define
set, configurable with the SEMGREP_PASCAL_DEFINES environment variable;
{$I} include files are searched next to the unit and in
SEMGREP_PASCAL_INCLUDE_PATH. Identifiers are matched case-insensitively.
